<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13328] Control.sh bash script swallow return code of CommandHandler and always return 0</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13328</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;After merging &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12367&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;IGNITE-12367&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;br/&gt;
control.sh always return 0, despite the fact that CommandHandler returns correct code.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For example:&lt;br/&gt;
Ignite 2.8.1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
Failed to execute baseline command=&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;collect&apos;&lt;/span&gt;
Latest topology update failed.
Connection to cluster failed. Latest topology update failed.
Command [BASELINE] finished with code: 2
Control utility has completed execution at: 2020-08-05T15:01:34.123
Execution time: 26627 ms
&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt; echo $?
0
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13321088">IGNITE-13328</key>
